{
 "about": "Bazaar discovery declarations for SINCOR's paid x402 endpoints, recorded in the SERVED shape (extensions.bazaar: info + schema) and generated from the same builders that construct the live 402 challenges \u2014 sincor2.x402_payments.build_payment_payload for the /x402/<resource> surface and sincor_x402 + sincor2.lane3 for the two Lane-3 endpoints. tests/pytest/test_bazaar_extensions_wiring.py asserts this file equals the code-generated declarations, so it cannot drift. Supersedes the 2026-10-26 prepared declarations, which used the discovery-catalog shape (input/output as siblings of info, an accepts echo, GET methods) that the current x402 extension spec does not define. Indexing additionally requires a paid call settled through the CDP Facilitator (founder-gated); declarations alone do not list an endpoint.",
